column17:
In addition, other versions of the IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories were also consulted to supplement and refine the estimation of GHG emissions and removals for Quang Binh Province, including:

“1996 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories” (hereafter referred to as IPCC 1996);

“2019 Refinement to the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories” (hereafter referred to as IPCC 2019);

“Good Practice Guidance and Uncertainty Management in National Greenhouse Gas Inventories (2000)”;

“Good Practice Guidance for Land Use, Land-Use Change and Forestry (2003)”.

For the AFOLU sector, estimations were conducted using the Agriculture, Forestry and Other Land Use (ALU) software tool, developed by Colorado State University (USA), which is based on the methodologies of the IPCC 2006 Guidelines.
